    <string name="srv_guest_desc">A guest can browse the Library and torrents, play videos on the screen and Chromecast, and search for subtitles. They can\'t add or remove torrents, put the computer to sleep, change settings or invite others. The code works once, for a day, so you can send it via a messenger app.</string>
    <string name="srv_member_desc">A household member can do everything, like this phone. The code works once, for 10 min.</string>
