    <string name="srv_phone_source_only">The agent comes from this phone (%1$s), no other server needed. Keep this window open until the installation finishes. The computer will download extras (subtitles, mpv, Python on Windows) from the internet; without them, on Linux the library and watching on the phone will work.</string>
