    <string name="srv_lite_windows">Lite install: Library, upload from phone, subtitles and screen (fetches mpv by itself). Paste the command into a PowerShell window, not into “Run” (Win+R): Defender blocks such a command when given directly.</string>
    <string name="srv_no_admin">Without administrator password</string>
